TEST create_order_success

RECEIVE HTTP:POST /orders
WITH {{payloads/create_order_request.json}}

EXPECT WRITE:POSTGRESQL orders
WITH {{payloads/create_order_request.json}}
VERIFY query CONTAINS 'orders'
VERIFY query NOT_CONTAINS 'DROP'

RESPOND HTTP:201
WITH {{payloads/create_order_response.json}}
NOISE
  body.id
  body.created_at
